     "up": {"title":"OAS or KWS: data worker or knowledge worker? (Challenge)","bloom":"Analyse","intro":"<p>The same software can appear on both sides. Decide by the worker and the task: processing and sharing information (a data worker) or creating new knowledge (a knowledge worker).</p>","items":[{"t":"A legal secretary in Kingstown, St. Vincent, formats a 40-page contract that the lawyer drafted, adds a table of contents and emails it to the client.","bin":0,"fb":"Formatting and sending a document someone else wrote is data work: OAS."},{"t":"A quantity surveyor in Port of Spain builds a 3D model of a new school and tests three roof designs to estimate materials.","bin":1,"fb":"Modelling and comparing designs creates new knowledge: KWS."},{"t":"An administrator at a hotel in Grand Anse, Grenada, uses a spreadsheet to type up the staff duty roster from the manager's handwritten notes.","bin":0,"fb":"A spreadsheet, but the task is copying and formatting information: OAS."},{"t":"A hydrologist at a water agency in Guyana uses spreadsheet models and rainfall data to simulate flooding along the Demerara River.","bin":1,"fb":"The same kind of software, but used by a professional to build models and new knowledge: KWS."},{"t":"A radiologist at a hospital in Nassau uses 3D imaging software to examine a CT scan and identify a tumour.","bin":1,"fb":"A professional analysing specialised data on a powerful workstation: KWS."},{"t":"The medical records clerk at the same hospital scans and indexes paper consent forms so they can be found quickly.","bin":0,"fb":"Document imaging and management by clerical staff: OAS."},{"t":"A marine biologist in Belize runs a computer simulation of coral bleaching under different sea temperatures.","bin":1,"fb":"Scientific simulation that creates new knowledge: KWS."},{"t":"An executive assistant in Castries sets up a video conference for the directors and shares the minutes in a cloud folder.","bin":0,"fb":"Scheduling, communicating and sharing documents: OAS."}],"win":"Excellent. You judged by the person and the task, not the program. A spreadsheet can be office automation for a clerk and a knowledge work tool for a scientist."}
