     "up": {"title":"Translate to the syllabus six (Challenge)","bloom":"Analyse","intro":"<p>A credit union in Mandeville, Jamaica, described its information system. Some of these items are easy to misplace. Sort each into the syllabus component (SO 2.2) an examiner would mark.</p>","items":[{"t":"The firmware program stored inside each card reader","bin":1,"fb":"Firmware is a set of instructions for the machine, so it is software, even though it lives on a chip."},{"t":"The UPS that keeps the server running during a power cut","bin":0,"fb":"Physical equipment: hardware."},{"t":"The database management system that runs the members' database","bin":1,"fb":"The DBMS is a program: software. The records it manages are data."},{"t":"Members' account balances and scanned signature images","bin":2,"fb":"Stored facts, including images, are data."},{"t":"The rule that loan officers must check two forms of ID before opening an account","bin":3,"fb":"An instruction for people: a procedure."},{"t":"The written disaster-recovery plan stating who restores the backups after a hurricane","bin":3,"fb":"Written steps telling people what to do: procedures."},{"t":"The external auditor who reads the system's monthly reports","bin":4,"fb":"Users include people who use the system's output, not only those who type into it."},{"t":"The contracted technician who installs security updates on the server","bin":4,"fb":"IT professionals who support the system are users in the syllabus list."},{"t":"The 4G backup link that takes over when the fibre line fails","bin":5,"fb":"A communication link that keeps data flowing: network."},{"t":"The VPN connection joining the Mandeville branch to head office in Kingston","bin":5,"fb":"A secure communication link between sites: network."}],"win":"Excellent. Firmware and the DBMS are software, the records are data, auditors and technicians are users, and backup links are network. Reports never appear: they are output."}
