     "stimulus": "<p class=\"passage\">Island Breeze Hotels group owns three hotels: one in Villa, one in Arnos Vale and one in Anguilla. Front-desk staff record check-ins and payments; the manager of each hotel reviews weekly occupancy figures; the revenue manager must decide next season's room rates; and the group's CEO is considering opening a fourth hotel in St. Kitts. The group also wants a system to help its maintenance technicians diagnose faults in air-conditioning units.</p>",
