      "prompt": "<ol type=\"a\"><li>Complete this definition: \"An information system is an organised combination of ______ that turns ______ into ______ to support an organisation.\" <i>(2 marks)</i></li><li>Front-desk staff record check-ins and payments. (i) Name the type of information system they use. <i>(1 mark)</i> (ii) Give ONE major input to it from the hotel. <i>(1 mark)</i> (iii) Give ONE major output from it. <i>(1 mark)</i></li><li>Name the type of information system used by (i) the hotel manager who reviews weekly occupancy figures <i>(1 mark)</i> and (ii) the revenue manager who tests different room rates <i>(1 mark)</i>.</li><li>Complete: \"A summarised report shows ______, for example ______, whereas an exception report shows only ______, for example ______.\" <i>(2 marks)</i></li><li>Complete: \"With an expert system, the technician enters ______ and the system gives ______.\" <i>(2 marks)</i></li></ol>",
