      "prompt": "<ol type=\"a\"><li>Name the <b>six</b> components of an information system. Beside each one, write the matching Seaside Pharmacy example from the word bank. <i>(6 marks)</i></li><li>Complete these sentences: (i) \"Software is a set of instructions for the ______, whereas procedures are instructions for the ______.\" <i>(1 mark)</i> (ii) \"The pharmacist follows the ______ to use the hardware and software correctly.\" <i>(1 mark)</i></li><li>After the hurricane, (i) which component failed? <i>(1 mark)</i> (ii) State ONE thing the pharmacy could not do because of this. <i>(1 mark)</i></li></ol>",
      "min": 70,
