     "intro": "<p>The Surfside Realty in Oranjestad is setting up a company email system: a mail server running Microsoft Exchange, with Outlook on every PC. Sort each item into the component of the IT system it belongs to.</p>",
     "main": "Which component of the IT system is this?",
