      "frame": "<p><b>(a)</b> (i) ... (ii) ... (iv) ... (v) ...<br><b>(b)</b> Saying \"Call home\" is a ... interface because the driver ...<br><b>(c)</b> (i) The technician uses a ... interface. (ii) It suits him because he is an ... who ...</p>",
