     "type": "sort",
     "game": true,
     "title": "In this role: IT professional or end user?",
     "intro": "<p>An IT professional works in one particular IT job role with the comprehensive skills for it. Anyone else using a system is an end user, even if they are \"good with computers\". Sort each person by the role they are playing in the situation described.</p>",
     "main": "In this situation, is the person acting as an IT professional or an end user?",
