     "up": {"title":"Match the IT role to the task (Challenge)","bloom":"Analyse","intro":"<p>These tasks are described by their purpose, and several sit close to another role. Match each IT professional to the task that belongs to that role.</p>","pairs":[{"l":"Database Administrator","r":"Tunes slow queries on a credit union's member database and decides which staff may update loan records"},{"l":"Applications Developer","r":"Writes the code for a new feature in an accounting package, working to the analyst's specification"},{"l":"Information Security Specialist","r":"Runs an authorised test attack on a hotel's network to find weaknesses before criminals do"},{"l":"Information Systems Manager","r":"Sets the IT department's three-year plan, its quality policy and the budget for replacing servers"},{"l":"IT Consultant","r":"Is hired for six weeks to advise a Dominica co-operative how IT could meet its export goals"},{"l":"IT Technical Support Officer","r":"Visits a classroom to diagnose why a projector will not show a laptop's screen"},{"l":"Network Engineer","r":"Adds a second Internet link and a firewall so a store's network stays up if one connection fails"},{"l":"Systems Analyst","r":"Interviews pharmacy staff, maps their workflow and produces a costed specification for developers"},{"l":"Systems Developer","r":"Writes diagnostic tests to find why a ferry booking system crashes, fixes it and recommends future developments"},{"l":"Web Designer","r":"Decides the layout, colour scheme and visitor journey for a resort's booking site"},{"l":"Back-end Web Developer","r":"Connects the resort's booking site to its room database and processes payments on the server"}],"win":"Excellent. You matched by purpose: data (DBA), code to specification (developer), defences (security), plans and budgets (IS manager), outside advice (consultant), user problems (support), availability (network), specification (analyst), diagnosis and improvement (systems developer), appearance (designer) and server-side building (back-end developer)."}
