       "h": "Look for clue words",
       "p": "<p>SMTP/HTTP/DNS: Application. Encrypt/compress/translate: Presentation. Checkpoint/session: Session. Segment/port/TCP/UDP: Transport. IP/packet/router: Network. MAC/frame/switch: Data Link. Bits/signals/cable: Physical.</p>"
