     "up": {"title":"Physical or logical step? (Challenge)","bloom":"Analyse","intro":"<p>The technician at Seaside Pharmacy has moved on to finer tasks. Sort each into the physical or logical half of configuration. Some involve hardware but are really settings, and some involve settings but are really physical work.</p>","main":"Physical or logical configuration step?","bins":["Physical (devices and cables)","Logical (settings)"],"items":[{"t":"Adding the staff tablets' MAC addresses to the allow list","bin":1,"fb":"MAC filtering is configured in the settings: logical."},{"t":"Creating a firewall rule that allows the POS program on TCP port 5050","bin":1,"fb":"A firewall rule is a setting: logical."},{"t":"Positioning the access point centrally to cover the dispensary and waiting room","bin":0,"fb":"Placing a device is physical, though it affects wireless coverage."},{"t":"Turning off remote management of the router from the WAN","bin":1,"fb":"A setting in the management page: logical."},{"t":"Disconnecting the unused waiting-room socket at the hub","bin":0,"fb":"Unplugging a port is physical security."},{"t":"Reserving a fixed IP address for the printer in the DHCP settings","bin":1,"fb":"An addressing setting: logical."},{"t":"Choosing PPPoE and entering the ISP's username and password","bin":1,"fb":"The WAN connection type is a setting: logical."},{"t":"Running cable through trunking and labelling both ends","bin":0,"fb":"Cable installation is physical work."},{"t":"Updating the router's firmware from the management page","bin":1,"fb":"Installing new software on the router is a logical task, even though the router is hardware."},{"t":"Choosing which LAN port each cable uses so it matches the labelled diagram","bin":0,"fb":"Connecting cables to the right ports is physical."}],"win":"Well sorted. Ask whether the task changes where something is or what it is plugged into (physical), or what it is told to do (logical)."}
