     "up": {"title":"Choose the storage and the channel (Challenge)","bloom":"Evaluate","intro":"<p>Organisations across the region need storage and transmission advice. Choose the BEST option for each need.</p>","items":[{"text":"A bank in Trinidad must keep seven years of transaction logs that are rarely read but legally required, as cheaply as possible, with an offline copy safe from ransomware.","options":["A flash drive in the manager's desk","A single SSD in the server","Tape stored offline","RAM"],"answer":2,"fb":"Tape is cheap per terabyte, suits sequential archives and, kept offline, cannot be encrypted by ransomware."},{"text":"A hotel's live booking database needs fast direct access and must survive a disk failure.","options":["SSDs in the server, plus nightly off-site backups","Tape only","RAM only","An optical disc read in sequence"],"answer":0,"fb":"SSDs give fast direct access; off-site backups protect against failure and disaster."},{"text":"A field officer in Guyana's interior sends short survey readings at irregular times over a slow link.","options":["Asynchronous transmission","Synchronous transmission","Full-duplex video","Tape"],"answer":0,"fb":"Irregular, character-by-character data with start and stop bits suits asynchronous transmission."},{"text":"Two systems exchange shipping data, but dates such as 03/04 are read as different days.","options":["They lack a common data standard for formats and encoding","The link is half-duplex","The cable is too long","The disk is too small"],"answer":0,"fb":"Sender and receiver must agree standards so the data is interpreted the same way."},{"text":"A seismic sensor network on Montserrat streams continuous data in large blocks.","options":["Asynchronous transmission","Simplex tape","A hub","Synchronous transmission, timed by a shared clock"],"answer":3,"fb":"Large continuous blocks suit synchronous transmission."},{"text":"Which of these storage types is volatile?","options":["SSD","RAM","Tape","Hard disk"],"answer":1,"fb":"RAM loses its contents when power is removed."}],"win":"Good judgement. You matched access mode, cost and safety to each storage need, and synchronisation and standards to each transmission need."}
