     "up": {"title":"Match the mechanism to the situation (Challenge)","bloom":"Evaluate","intro":"<p>Match each security mechanism to the situation where it is the BEST answer to the risk described.</p>","pairs":[{"l":"Two-factor log-in (password and phone code)","r":"Payroll staff at a Barbados firm need stronger protection than a password alone"},{"l":"Proximity key card with time limits","r":"Contract cleaners at a Kingston office may enter only between 6 p.m. and 10 p.m."},{"l":"Iris scanner","r":"A data vault in Curaçao needs a door control that cannot be lent or copied"},{"l":"Full-disk encryption","r":"Field officers' laptops in Guyana may be stolen on the road"},{"l":"Uninterruptible power supply (UPS)","r":"A server in Grenada keeps corrupting files when power cuts strike during saves"},{"l":"Range check","r":"Clerks keep entering stock quantities with an extra zero"},{"l":"Account lockout","r":"Someone is trying hundreds of passwords on the manager's account"},{"l":"Visitor log and escort","r":"Contractors are working inside a ministry building for a week"}],"win":"Very good. Each recommendation targets a specific risk, which is how Paper 02 rewards justified choices."}
