     "up": {"title":"Choosing the right link (Challenge)","bloom":"Evaluate","q":"The owner of Bonaire Dive Centre wants the logo on every page to return visitors to the home page, and the link must keep working when the site moves to a new host. Which code is BEST?","options":[{"t":"&lt;img src=\"logo.png\" href=\"index.html\"&gt;","fb":"img has no href attribute; the image must be wrapped in an a element to become a link."},{"t":"&lt;a href=\"https://oldhost.example.com/index.html\"&gt;&lt;img src=\"logo.png\" alt=\"Home\"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;","fb":"An absolute link to the old host would break when the site moves."},{"t":"&lt;a href=\"index.html\"&gt;&lt;img src=\"logo.png\" alt=\"Home\"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;","ok":true,"fb":"Correct. A relative link to index.html survives a change of host, and the alt text says where the image link goes."},{"t":"&lt;a href=\"#index\"&gt;&lt;img src=\"logo.png\" alt=\"Home\"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;","fb":"#index is a bookmark within the current page, not a link to the home page."}]}
