     "stimulus": "<p class=\"passage\">The Hato Reading Club meets every Saturday at a community centre and wants a one-page web site. The page must show the club's name as a heading, a short welcome paragraph, the club logo (logo.png), the next three books as a list, a table of meeting dates, a sign-up form and a link to the public library's web site.</p>",
     "prompt": "<p>Write the HTML code for the page. Your code must include:</p><ol type=\"a\"><li>the complete document structure with a page title and one comment; <i>(3 marks)</i></li><li>a main heading styled with the <b>style</b> attribute (centred, dark blue), and a paragraph containing at least one bold word; <i>(3 marks)</i></li><li>the logo image with suitable attributes and an ordered or unordered list of three books; <i>(3 marks)</i></li><li>a table with a header row (Date, Book, Venue) and at least two data rows; <i>(3 marks)</i></li><li>a form with a text box for the member's name, radio buttons for \"Adult\" or \"Teen\", and a submit button, plus a hyperlink to https://www.example.org/library. <i>(3 marks)</i></li></ol>",
